Scope of this license

The MIT License below covers only the contents of this repository: the example
ChatGPT desktop plugin, its scripts, tests, documentation, and synthetic demo
data. It does not cover Redis Iris or any Redis service or software the plugin
connects to, including Redis Agent Memory, Redis Agent Playbooks, and the
redis-iris SDK. Redis Iris is offered under a separate Redis license; for
details see https://redis.io/iris.

Two demo documents, context-models/management-agenda/v1/corpus/documents/
final-report.md and minutes-kickoff.md, come from the AMI Meeting Corpus
(https://groups.inf.ed.ac.uk/ami/corpus/) and remain under their original
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

